# Release binaries are NOT tracked. A committed .aab silently goes stale -- the one that used to
# live at app/release/ predated the FSRS-6 work by dozens of commits and would have shipped the
# retired scheduler if anyone had uploaded it. Build and sign from a tagged commit instead.
